node_modules/
.svelte-kit/
*.local
*.log

# NOTE on `frontend/dist/`:
# Go's `embed` package respects `.gitignore` since Go 1.21 — any
# file matched here is excluded from `//go:embed` directives.
# Therefore `frontend/dist/` and its contents are NOT ignored:
# the Go binary embeds the SPA from frontend/dist/ via
# `//go:embed frontend/dist/index.html` in services/web/spa.go.
# The placeholder index.html is committed; real SvelteKit build
# output is generated by `make web-frontend-build` and overwrites
# it on every CI/local build.
#
# The `*.bak` exclusion below is a safety net for accidentally
# generated backups (e.g. `index.html.bak` from a botched
# svelte-kit emit) — the embed would otherwise pick them up too.
